    "long_instructions": "How much pizza does a 20-person party need? Each guest will want 1, 2, or 3 slices. You're building a simulation to see if 42 slices will be enough.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. In the `simulate_party` function, define a variable to keep track of the total slices needed.\r\n2. For each guest, use `get_random_slices` to simulate how many slices they want. Add their slices to the total.\r\n3. Return the total.\r\n4. If you need more than 42 slices, print a message saying you ran out. Otherwise, print a message that says you have enough.",
